config VIDEO_V4L2_LOOPBACK
	tristate "V4L2 loopback device"
	depends on VIDEO_DEV
	help
	  Video devices whose output a userspace program writes and other
	  programs open as an ordinary camera (v4l2loopback 0.15.0, ported to
	  6.18). agentc's remote mode presents the browser's camera on one,
	  for apps that open /dev/video* themselves.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called v4l2loopback.
